  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help 30 women and girls escape human trafficking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hagar&apos;s Survivor Care project in Cambodia will provide victims of human trafficking, slavery, and abuse with holistic and life-saving care. The trauma of trafficking runs deep, but as Hagar&apos;s dedicated frontline team supports each individual, survivors will heal and rebuild their lives. This project will provide holistic, wraparound care for each survivor for one year, including safe shelter, trauma counseling, medical care, education, job placement, and small business start-up support.</narrative>
  </description>
